one team per game: close the thirteen confirmed review items

- verify_card judges the model main() built the card from (LAST_GAME_MODEL),
  never a possibly older mlb-game-model.json on disk;
- same-game parlay legs: each game's best ALLOWED leg (build_game_lines
  winner=), never no leg because the richest was on the other team;
- MLB: the collector's game-model rebuild re-judges the published card
  (refilter_game_lines: unstarted rows only, nothing added);
- card.expected_by_game shared by the card and the re-filter;
- tests: per-market fits checked against win_chances, no-win-chance,
  th

feat(dev): redesigned overlay with perf, tune, state and log tabs

Toolbar with snapshot and scene restart; health-coloured frame graph with
headroom and hitch attribution (game vs outside); jitter no longer flagged;
changed-param markers, per-param reset, copy changes; live inspect() state;
error badge and log. Runtime errors move into DevSession.

